          "id": "demo05OpenAi",
          "name": "OpenAI (demo 05)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## Query path: question -> agent -> Qdrant tool -> answer with sources\n- Tool = Qdrant Vector Store in \"Retrieve Documents (As Tool for AI Agent)\" mode, top-k 5, collection lumen_kb.\n- Embeddings must be the SAME model as at ingestion (text-embedding-3-small).\n- Dense only: no BM25 / hybrid in this node (hybrid lives in a script, see demo 01 and homework).\n- Temperature 0. Refusal phrase is fixed in the system prompt."
      },
